OL,4,G0400FOwain Wyn Evans
OL,5,     GWelcome to Early Breakfast with
OL,6,     GOwain Wyn Evans, featuring
OL,7,     GAirdrum Anthems. Owain asks if
OL,8,     Gyou remember what you used to
OL,9,     Gcircle in the toy catalogue as
OL,10,     Gthe nation starts wish lists!
OL,11,G0630FThe Scott Mills Breakfast Show
OL,12,     GScott's catching up with Jack
OL,13,     GWhitehall, as he swaps comedy for
OL,14,     Gdrama! Plus Tuesday's Easiest
OL,15,     GQuiz and the Birthday Game.
OL,16,G0930FGary Davies
OL,17,     GGary brings big tunes, big names
OL,18,     Gand big laughs to weekdays. And
OL,19,     GVernon pops up for the second
OL,20,     Gpart of his Tracks Of My Years
OL,21,     Gconversation with legendary
OL,22,     Gfrontman Jon Bon Jovi.
